{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRYFIRE is a no-nonsense tactical shooter, built by a small team who grew up playing the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plan every move or push your aim to the limit\u2014every round counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play solo or bring friends; it\u2019s free, no pay-to-win, no lootboxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Quick rounds, tight maps, and plenty of ways to outsmart the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small group, building what we want to play. Expect solid gunplay, regular updates, and zero marketing B.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922160?t=1755477794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/ee7506d6a1ff3cd65166421c49c3802897d08464/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755477794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/1007e875b681edacf628c9906a9febf78e342d29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755477794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922160/1007e875b681edacf628c9906a9febf78e342d29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755477794","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains frequent violence, including gunfire, blood effects, and player death animations. No sexual content is present. Some players may find the depiction of realistic firearms and combat disturbing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRYFIRE is a no-nonsense tactical shooter, built by a small team who grew up playing the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plan every move or push your aim to the